<title>FRANCE: MOTOR RACING-WORLD UNDERANCE CHAMPIONSHIP RESULT.</title>
<headline>MOTOR RACING-WORLD UNDERANCE CHAMPIONSHIP RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>NOGARO, France 1996-10-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading placings in the</p>
<p>tenth round of the world endurance championship on Sunday:</p>
<p>1. Ray Bellm/James Weaver (Britain) McLaren four hours zero</p>
<p>minutes 33.066 seconds</p>
<p>2. Pierre-Henn Raphanel/Lindsey Owen-Jones (France) McLaren one</p>
<p>minute 09 seconds behind</p>
<p>3. Michel Ferte/Olivier Thevenin (France) Ferrari 153 laps</p>
<p>4. Anders Olofsson (Sweden)/Luciano della Noce/Max Angelleli</p>
<p>(Italy) Ferrari 153 laps</p>
</text>
